## Ⅴ. TORUS COORDINATE SYSTEM

```
# TORUS PARAMETRIC EQUATIONS
x(r, θ, z) = (PHI + r * cos(θ)) * cos(z * PI)
y(r, θ, z) = (PHI + r * cos(θ)) * sin(z * PI)
z_pos(r, θ, z) = r * sin(θ)

# COORDINATE RANGES
r ∈ [0, 1]           # Radial distance from ring center
θ ∈ [0, TAU]         # Angular position around ring
z ∈ [-1, 1]          # Vertical position (maps to ring N1-N12)
t ∈ [0, ∞)           # Temporal beat number

# RING MAPPING
ring_from_z(z) = floor((z + 1) / 2 * 12) + 1
z_from_ring(n) = (n - 1) / 6 - 1  # n ∈ [1, 12]
```

